cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this package, please cite the paper below."
title: "RefVerifier: ATIQSER '26 Reproduction Package"
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  Inputs, ground truth, per-item run outputs and scoring rules for the
  evaluations reported in "RefVerifier: Semi-Automated Reference Claim
  Verification for Scientific Manuscripts" (ATIQSER '26). All LLM results use
  gpt-5.6-terra. The RefVerifier prototype source is not part of this release.
